# Pairs with HintOnlyWhileOpen. Design section 3 (S7): the hint row is removed
# when the switch's token closes, in the same write.
MODULE: HintOnlyWhileOpenCloseKeepsHint
TARGET: HintOnlyWhileOpen
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: the batched close closes a switch without removing its hint
PERTURBS: Close

--- FIND
    /\ hint' = IF Pending THEN hint ELSE Null
--- REPLACE
\* MUTATION: the hint stays.
    /\ hint' = hint
--- END
